  "job_B3.3.28_20251003_114714": {
    "chunk_text": "aneode ealswa se halge him fores\u00e6de on \u00e6r, & mare eorfo\u00f0e he adreah, \u00feone we He com to him anes nihtes on swefne swy\u00f0e brihte scinende, & him to cw\u00e6\u00f0, Eala, \u00feu king, hw\u00e6t He wear\u00f0 afyrht on swefne f\u00e6rlice swy\u00f0e, & \u00feeh \u00fean halgen geandswerode, Eala, leof, he cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ic eam ealles godes ben\u00e6med & mines kynerices. Se halge him andswerode, Ic eam Neotus, \u00fein freond, & ic nu blissige mid heofene Kinge. Gehyht nu on his mihte, \u00feonne becumst \u00feu \u00e6fter Eastern to \u00feinen \u00e6\u00f0ele, & \u00fee togeanes cum\u00f0 \u00fein Ic \u00fee toforen fare, \u00feu me \u00e6fterfolge, & \u00fein folc samod. Ic so\u00f0lice todr\u00e6fe ealle \u00feine wi\u00f0erwinnen, & \u00feone king, \u00fee \u00fee togeanes win\u00f0, to geleafen gebege. Hit gelamp \u00fea eall swa, & Gu\u00f0rum se h\u00e6\u00f0ene king com to \u00e6lfrede \u00fean cristene kinge, mid \u00fereottene & he twelf dages \u00e6fter \u00fean her on lande wunede mid mycelre blisse, & sy\u00f0\u00f0en gesund gewende mid \u00dea weox \u00e6lfredes cynerice, & his word wide sprang, \u00fe\u00e6t he on godcunden gewriten wel gel\u00e6red w\u00e6s, Eac is to wytene, \u00fe\u00e6t se king \u00c6lfred manega bec \u00feurh Godes gast gedyhte. & binnen twam & twentig gearen his cynerices \u00feiss eor\u00f0lice lif forlet, & to \u00fean ecen gewende, swa Eala, m\u00e6n \u00fea leofe, \u00fea w\u00e6ron gode dages on \u00fean gode time for cristenes folcas geearnunge, & Nu is \u00e6ighwan",
